  abstract      = "Recent advances in Natural Language Processing, and in
                   particular on the construction of very large pre-trained
                   language representation models, is opening up new
                   perspectives on the construction of conversational
                   information seeking (CIS) systems. In this paper we
                   investigate the usage of in-context learning and pre-trained
